{"items":[{"id":"792201533","root":"792201434","user":{"id":"1547002","name":"望帝春心脱杜鹃","avatar":"48420cd2e1a41fccd47f0a39"},"text":"换个时间，不是在我与其他人分享成果的时间段。我会很感激友人对我关照关心关爱。\n换个角度，这个可能会存在负面影响，就蒙声发大财，不要到处声张，慢慢减缓扩散。也不是不能接受。","time":1691200778494,"floor":1,"likes":1,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"","replyToUserId":"0","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false},{"id":"792201656","root":"792201434","user":{"id":"1547002","name":"望帝春心脱杜鹃","avatar":"48420cd2e1a41fccd47f0a39"},"text":"沟通方式多种多样，拒绝沟通，是一个很伤朋友心的行为。有幸和诸位在站里通行，为诸位的开心而开心，为诸位郁郁而感到着急，为诸位遭遇感同身受。同行不易，望万万珍重","time":1691201185571,"floor":1,"likes":0,"isUp":false,"replyTo":"望帝春心脱杜鹃","replyToUserId":"1547002","parentCommentId":null,"images":[],"reportedReplies":0,"hot":false}],"media":{"48420cd2e1a41fccd47f0a39":{"src":"https://tx-free-imgs2.acfun.cn/bs2/acfun-image/1547002_7b84c9d8656c4d5f9d69e00be4553097.png","fallbacks":["https://tx-free-imgs.acfun.cn/aBV4B2QKFU-qaA3Yz-jAVVRr-2Qzam2-QvmMVf.jpg?imageslim","https://imgs.aixifan.com/newUpload/1547002_7b84c9d8656c4d5f9d69e00be4553097.png"]}},"emotions":{}}